Subject: Test262 parity fixes

What this does
  

Why we need it
  The register VM diverged from the stack VM on catch unwinding, staged argument windows, mixed string/rope and BigInt strict equality, `nip_catch`, cross-realm calls/TDZ throws and for-await-of close on normal completion.

What it adds
  Catch unwinder frame/index + DRC adopt; `regvm_stage_args` `below` bound; `regvm_strict_eq` STRING/ROPE by content, BigInt to slow path; real `nip_catch` pop; record calls use callee realm, `local_check` throws use `regvm_caller_realm`; `iter_value_done` clears the iterator slot on done.

Needs a bytecode version bump
  No.
